  "question": {
    "text": "Let a vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;be coplanar with vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then a possible value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left left\"><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> is equal to:",
